<title>USA: Omaha cattle $1.00-2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $1.00-2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers slow, $1.00-2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 63.00-64.00, few 64.50. Select 61.00-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to largely Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 63.00-64.00. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
